{"id":"00022","root":"uni00022_1","name":{"ja":"さくら","en":"Sakura"},"title":{"ja":"【影の支配者】","en":"【Shadow Ruler】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【影の支配者】 さくら","en":"【Shadow Ruler】 Sakura"},"aliases":["Igawa Sakura","Demon Sakura"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":22,"profile":{"ja":"さくらの対魔因子が魔族覚醒した状態の姿。姉であるアサギ同様戦闘特化型。戦いの中に身をおいたさくらの教え子達。彼らは任務中に行方が分からなくなり、さくらは彼らを捜索する。その中で山奥の人が立ち寄らない山荘で魔族や悪徳政治家が関与している山荘を発見し、教え子達が無残な扱われ方をされており、怒りその場にいた魔族や悪徳政治家を殺してしまう。教え子たちを救えなかった虚しさと怒りから、心の中のもう一人の自分に声を掛けられ、その声に応じてしまい、さくらは魔族として覚醒してしまう。その力は他の魔族をも圧倒し、アサギ、エドウィン・ブラック、カーラなどの実力者しか勝てないのではといわれている。","en":"Igawa Sakura's Taimanin essence has awakened in a demon-infused form. Like her older sister Asagi, she is a combat-specialized fighter. While Sakura's pupils were on a mission, they vanished, prompting her to search for them. She discovered a secluded mountain lodge—abandoned by locals—where demons and corrupt politicians were involved. There, she found her pupils brutally mistreated and, enraged, she slaughtered the demons and politicians present. The emptiness and fury of failing to save them drew a voice from another side of her heart; answering that voice caused Sakura to awaken as a demon herself. Her newfound power overwhelms even other demons, and it is said only heavyweights such as Asagi, Edwin Black, and Kara could possibly stand against her."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"黒岩心々","forms":[{"id":"uni00022_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[934,1868],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[139,278],"def":[124,248],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":37,"skills":["2","63"]},{"id":"uni00022_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1368,2736],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[213,426],"def":[183,367],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":37,"skills":["2","63","64"]},{"id":"uni00022_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1802,3604],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[292,5